            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes I agree with that.\r\n\r\nThis was something I spotted while looking at my alternative suggestion for https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7964. That PR did add a macro, although only in a Graal/non-Graal way so it probably could have gone further.\r\n\r\nSo I was trying to keep this minimal in the hope of not deliberately adding conflicts to that PR, and then to propose an improvement to that one with the macros.",
